                    <td><strong style="color:#16a34a;">+₹7,009 Net Wealth</strong></td>
                    <td><strong style="color:#2563eb;">+₹32,725 (Loan active)</strong></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong style="color:var(--primary-900, #0f172a);">Year 3.7 (EMI Payback)</strong></td>
